汤的味道有多棒
how good that soup was.

529
00:19:00,180 --> 00:19:02,800
抱歉我最近觉得自己不太有魅力
Well, I'm sorry if I haven't been feeling very attractive lately.

530
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:04,820
我可是每天都告诉你 你有多帅哦
I tell you how handsome you are every day.

531
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:07,080
你们俩不是长得很像吗
Don't you guys look exactly alike?

532
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:10,620
你没事吧
Are you okay?

533
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:12,120
没事
I'm all right.

534
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:14,380
你想上床大家抱抱一下吗
You wanna get in bed and cuddle for a little while?

535
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:17,121
不用了...好吧
No, it's-- yeah.

536
00:19:17,121 --> 00:19:18,549
-来啦 -对啊 来这里
- Come on. - Yeah, get in here.

537
00:19:18,549 --> 00:19:20,132
这才对嘛
There you go. There you go.

538
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,120
太好了 你还活着
Oh, good. You're alive.

539
00:19:25,280 --> 00:19:26,900
当我听说你离开 独自穿过树林时
When I heard you left and walked through the woods,

540
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,700
我心想 "会不会被抓去肛门探测"
I wondered, "was there anal probing?"

541
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:32,100
被外星人"探测" 而不是被骗子骗
By an alien, not a grifter.

542
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:34,840
是你发短信说想见我吗
You texted you wanted to see me?

543
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:36,460
是某人啦
Well, someone did.

544
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,120
生日快乐
Happy Birthday!

545
00:19:39,360 --> 00:19:40,220
来 快吹[吹箫]
Now, come on, blow.

546
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:41,960
我不是很想做这事
I don't really feel like doing that.

547
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:43,360
欢迎来到女人的世界
Welcome to our world.

548
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:49,640
安迪 我为发生的一切感到抱歉
Andy, I'm so sorry about everything.

549
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:50,660
没关系
It's okay.

550
00:19:50,740 --> 00:19:52,240
我坐公车的时候 有很多时间思考
I had a lot of time to think on the bus,

551
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:54,340
因为我要转车 然后转的车坏了
and the other bus, and the bus I had to take

552
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:55,380
我又得再转一辆车
when that bus broke down.

553
00:19:56,380 --> 00:19:57,220
如果能让你感觉好点
If it makes you feel any better,

554
00:19:57,380 --> 00:19:58,760
我的后背全是绳子擦伤的痕迹呢
I have rope burns all down my back.

555
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:02,300
安迪 抱歉忘了你的生日
Andy, I'm sorry about your birthday.

556
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:04,600
我们是一个月前告诉彼此对方生日的
We told each other those dates a month ago.

557
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:06,160
我都不指望你会记得我的
I wouldn't expect you to remember mine.

558
00:20:06,540 --> 00:20:08,040
1987年5月28日
May 28th, 1987.

559
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,440
早上10点30分
10:30 in the morning.

560
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:12,420
是晚上10点30分 所以你也不完美嘛
10:30 at night, so you're not perfect.

561
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:15,940
你的人生很忙
Look, you have a really busy life,

562
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:17,960
你也很要强 这点我很敬佩
and you're really ambitious, which I admire,

563
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:20,780
但我不想做一个要等着你人生里有我的人
but I wanna be more than someone you get to eventually.

564
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,520
当然不是这样
And you deserve that.

565
00:20:22,540 --> 00:20:24,680
只不过我现在要以事业为先...
It's just I have to put the business first right now--

566
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:25,720
我明白
And I get that.

567
00:20:25,900 --> 00:20:28,040
我觉得我们该冷静一下
I just--I think we should take a break.

568
00:20:29,020 --> 00:20:30,400
你想冷静一下
You wanna take a break?

569
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:32,660
或许 是吧
Maybe, yeah.

570
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:35,160
你真正想说的是不是"分手"
Are you saying take a break

571
00:20:35,300 --> 00:20:36,200
"冷静一下"不过是
'cause you really mean "Break up,"

572
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,140
你不忍心才这么说
but you're trying to be nice?

573
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,200
或许 是吧
Maybe, yeah.

574
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:41,500
抱歉这一切来得这么突然
I'm sorry if this seems sudden,

575
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:42,900
但我了解自己
but I know me,

576
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:44,500
或许长痛不如短痛
and maybe it's better sooner than later.

577
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:46,800
我回来啦
I'm back!

578
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,520
我还把我的伴娘都带来了
And I brought my bridesmaids!

579
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,880
看起来生意在好转嘛
Looks like business is picking up.

580
00:20:53,140 --> 00:20:54,800
要不见你 会很难吧
It's gonna be hard not to see you.

581
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:56,440
是啊 的确
Yeah, it will be.

582
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:58,020
我就在你10英尺外工作
I work 10 feet away.

583
00:20:59,340 --> 00:21:00,520
这边 姑娘们
This way, ladies.

584
00:21:00,700 --> 00:21:02,980
我们要尝遍她们所有的小蛋糕
We're gonna taste every cupcake they have!

585
00:21:03,580 --> 00:21:05,540
现在是带我走的最佳时机
This is the time to take me!

586
00:21:06,180 --> 00:21:07,400
快点 最后一次求你了
Come on, final offer!

587
00:21:07,500 --> 00:21:08,940
ET 阿福[电视剧外星人]
E.T.? Alf?

588
00:21:09,500 --> 00:21:10,480
克里斯蒂娜·里奇
Christina Ricci?
